# Frozen Vault integration bundle

This bundle combines the exact tested production adapter with the accepted independent final review. Install only entries in integration-copy-list.json. The 23 live app files comprise five byte-identical runtime modules, twelve tests, five helpers and the app README. Shared host, catalog, storage and public assets here are prior validation infrastructure; they are not proposed replacements.

Current-layout 41/41 and the separate author replay 11/11 were executed in the frozen adapter before this preservation-only assembly. Their source identities remain exact. The accepted independent review separately ran 11/11 and real private-browser draft/restore/save/restart checks; it executed no original assembly. No acceptance rerun, browser operation or production edit occurred during bundle assembly. Historical compatibility18, earlier failed probes and all original counts remain preserved without rebinding. Original24 assembly loads, DOM25 candidate groups, author-repeated DOM11, five shared-host test processes and one private route host remain separate.

Every public .local directory segment is renamed private-study-records with original-path/hash mappings. Frozen historical metadata remains inert and exact; the new current public preservation manifest names the actual adapted paths. Four authenticated full original source ZIP copies remain bundle-local and are excluded from integration. No original EXE/DLL carrier is embedded. Native runtime imports no original helper/runtime. Full product parity, original-grade security and superiority remain false.

This bundle is frozen. Parent production integration and its final browser/full-suite checks remain subsequent work.
